      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But that will not validate an action that is otherwise illegal and without jurisdiction."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a623ccee2365424ebaa123e2bc7f8787_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In fact, Section 38 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 would call upon the owner of the premises to assume responsibility for the seized materials."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0d4146b4bb924663882c2b2b72f3bb4b_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A similar approach can very well be adopted in this case also."
    },
